<title>CANADA: Canada ag markets closed Monday for civic holiday.</title>
<headline>Canada ag markets closed Monday for civic holiday.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian agriculture markets will be closed  Monday in observance of a civic holiday.</p>
<p>Canadian Wheat Board, Winnipeg Commodity Exchange and Manitoba Pork  will be closed and not issue cash, futures or forward contract prices.</p>
<p>Grain handling firms Manitoba Pool Elevators and United Grain Growers  Ltd will not issue elevator spot prices.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
